{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDExLS0yMDE1L1NlZHVjZWQlMjBBbmQlMjBBYmFuZG9uZWQlMjAlMjgyMDEzJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Seduced And Abandoned","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gaXPdoGRurNLgfyRrUDKsa95fYa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/spgZcy2k1SSjnvBGONXKMxQWXhC.jpg","description":"SEDUCED AND ABANDONED combines acting legend Alec Baldwin with director James Toback as they lead us on a troublesome and often hilarious journey of raising financing for their next feature film. Moving from director to financier to star actor, the two players provide us with a unique look behind the curtain at the world's biggest and most glamourous film festival, shining a light on the bitter-sweet relationship filmmakers have with Cannes and the film business. Featuring insights from directors Martin Scorsese, 'Bernando Bertolucci' and Roman Polanski; actors Ryan Gosling and Jessica Chastain and a host of film distribution luminaries.","releaseInfo":"2013","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"100 min","cast":["James Toback","Alec Baldwin","Bérénice Bejo","Bernardo Bertolucci","James Caan","Jessica Chastain","Francis Ford Coppola","Ryan Gosling"],"director":["James Toback"],"released":"2013-05-20T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Beyond the glamour of Cannes lies the naked truth of moviemaking.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"James Toback","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qW8wC5GJBWUHOVOlRem877u39Dq.jpg"},{"name":"Alec Baldwin","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hzKy7x574eeUS3wt1R3yvWBRpeR.jpg"},{"name":"Bérénice Bejo","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/geRiss2B8CWgmY0VZW0dHsWiAOt.jpg"},{"name":"Bernardo Bertolucci","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b0W7CtXxbo24sX8TPnDlLTYfc2E.jpg"},{"name":"James Caan","character":"Self","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/z2Lz3rtxZ7aJjzBUkCnExv